<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41572" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-φύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make to grow, produce on</i> or <i>besides,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.9.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2 and pf.
			
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέφῡν,
				ἐπιπέφυκα</span>:—<i>grow upon,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σήματι</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπέφυκε ἐλαίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.34
				</span></i>
			; esp. as an excrescence, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				605a3
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ψυχαῖς ἐ. μελανίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.81.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐπιπεφυκώς,</span> with or
			without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμήν,</span>
			<i>the conjunctiva,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Steph.
				<u>in Hp.</u>
				1.88
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>: hence, <i>adhere, cling closely to</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφύω</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφοῖν
				τοῖν χεροῖν</span> with both hands, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.10.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				36.15
			</span></i> ; esp. of dogs, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοῖς θηρίοις</span>
			<i>stick close to</i> them, <i>run</i> them <i>hard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				1
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς πλείστοις..οἷον κῆρες
					ἐπιπεφύκασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					937d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.345
			</span></i> ; <i>cleave to,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθοῖς</span> interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.6c
			</span></i> ; <i>attack,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				51
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόγματι,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερδικεῖν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.694e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.86b
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφύντα νέον ἄνδρα</span>
			an upstart <i>interloper,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cleom.</u>
				16
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
